[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4136992550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117849#issuecomment-4136992550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117849","id":4136992550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72lX8m","user":{"login":"WoodWood1299","id":96357948,"node_id":"U_kgDOBb5OPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96357948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299","html_url":"https://github.com/WoodWood1299","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T17:52:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T17:52:22Z","body":"I had considered before tagging each dialog manually, however I thought it might be harder to test, review and maintain. I've previously tagged each Dialog from AcceptDialog and ConfirmationDialog according to their content (and therefore if they should be resizable or not), however there were some cases where I was uncertain if it should or shouldn't be resizable. For an example, if a dialog is a simple text box, with only a couple buttons, but the text includes a file path (which can have an arbitrary length), should it be able to be resized? Attached here is my previous analysis on each dialogs' content. I divided them into 4 different types, according to how they are used in the code (Inheritance vs Instances) [Dialog Content Type.md](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26284143/Dialog.Content.Type.md). Should I go ahead and tag the dialogs as analyzed?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4136992550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4295665143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117849#issuecomment-4295665143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117849","id":4295665143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAAql9w","user":{"login":"WoodWood1299","id":96357948,"node_id":"U_kgDOBb5OPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96357948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299","html_url":"https://github.com/WoodWood1299","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T11:07:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T11:07:07Z","body":"@bruvzg Do you agree with these changes?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4295665143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4414111513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117849#issuecomment-4414111513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117849","id":4414111513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBxn_GQ","user":{"login":"WoodWood1299","id":96357948,"node_id":"U_kgDOBb5OPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96357948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299","html_url":"https://github.com/WoodWood1299","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WoodWood1299/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T01:08:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T01:08:27Z","body":"Reworked based on your feedback. I decided to go with the approach I previously described, however I was a bit more restrictive in what shouldn't be resizable, in order to avoid regressions. Instead of runtime auto-detection based on a list of classes, `set_flag(FLAG_RESIZE_DISABLED, true)` is now set explicitly on each specific dialog at construction time.\r\n\r\nOnly bounded plaintext content was flagged as non-resizable. Dialogs with things such as file paths or other variable length-content were kept as resizable. The earlier auto-detection was removed via rebase, and the branch is now on top of current `master`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4414111513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745816877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117849#issuecomment-4745816877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117849","id":4745816877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGt9rLQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:27Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745816877/reactions","total_count":